  "title": "Prize-Winning Baby Back Ribs",
  "description": "Cooking ribs on the grill is easy with this foolproof recipe for spiced baby back ribs cooked low and slow until fall-off-the-bone tender and delicious.",
  "authors": [
    "Bonnie"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-09-09T13:27:45-04:00",
